{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_03",
  "title": "安全屋攻防戰",
  "storyCode": "OD-3",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "80c205949a2523369619e1ca837b75bb02b922c4e7d511deef3aa260f8ab8f71",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "銃？雇傭兵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你在說什麼瞎話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我說的全是真的，老大！他們拿著大型銃，賈曼被他們幹掉了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "拿著大型銃的雇傭兵？薩科塔人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是想告訴我，你們任務失敗，是因為四個薩科塔人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們應該不是薩科塔人......大概？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不是薩科塔人但是拿著大型銃的傭兵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果你要撒謊，你可以把故事杜撰得真實一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他說的是真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他說的是真的，那幾個武裝人員確實不是薩科塔人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "賈曼被打爛了腦袋，但是我沒看到箭矢與弩彈，薩卡茲人可沒有那麼脆弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這些人不在你的計劃範圍內。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "之前合約裡可沒提到我們還得對付一群全副武裝拿著銃器的傭兵，老闆，得加錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那些傭兵現在在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們不在感染者社區了，我們的人在排查，沒見到太大動靜，應該還沒離開鎮子周邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "老混蛋那邊的狀況怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你父親的手下都很厲害，尤其是你的妹妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們幹掉了幾個衛兵，但沒能突破宅邸的防線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你那科學家的怪物幹得不錯，但是你找來的術師們就是廢物，很多怪物折損得毫無意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們已經是我能雇到的術師裡最像樣的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "除非你們的老闆願意指派術師過來，不然抱怨也沒用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那就讓你的科學家多造點怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "或者換個戰術，強行攻打大宅行不通。你家的大宅就是個要塞，你妹妹也不是省油的燈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "老混蛋呢？他還是躲在屋子裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我根本就沒看到你的父親，自始至終他都沒有露面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈......我就知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我就知道他出事了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "繼續盯著大宅，有情況立刻告訴我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "關於我剛才提到的“換個戰術”的部分，你的動作得快一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這是薩卡茲傭兵的直覺。事情拖得越久，破綻就越多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我確實有備用計劃，不過我需要時間來安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "雖然我對自己的實驗成果非常自信，但是從表情來看，你似乎沒有類似的體驗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "來吧，說說看，又是哪個環節出問題了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你需要加快一點進度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "除了毫無意義的催促，你還能講點更有建設性的意見嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我帶給你的屍體夠多了，我還需要至少二十隻這種怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "畸變體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "“這種怪物”叫源石畸變體，它是有名字的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "突變體、畸變體，我才不在乎這東西叫什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我需要更多的怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我之前已經給你不少了，這麼快就死光了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我很好奇......你的手下是怎麼操縱畸變體的？依靠你們的“源石技藝”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這算是什麼？超能力？神秘學？法術？原理是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "來吧，滿足我的好奇心，我想和你手下的那些“術師”聊一聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "幹好你的本職工作，學者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "源石技藝不是你現在需要操心的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等事成之後，你有的是時間做你的研究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（俄語）我對你的事業還真沒什麼信心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不過說到時間，我有沒有提醒過你？其實你的時間也不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這些源石畸變體的壽命不會超過一周，無論你想要做什麼，動作都得快一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你又在搞什麼鬼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這是代價，是你毫無耐心的代價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你想要高速製造這些畸變體，又想要它們孔武有力，你還希望它們沒有任何缺點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你當真覺得天底下有這樣的好事情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我說過，不要和我耍花招，學者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我很忙，沒時間和你開玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "既然你這麼不滿意，我建議你自己來，動用你的聰明才智，搞定我這個專業人士短時間無法解決的基因工程問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "當然，你也可以給我帶來更多的材料，給我更多的時間，來為你無趣的“家庭倫理劇”添磚加瓦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "科學是公平的，你總是有得選。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不要和我油嘴滑舌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "繼續你的工作，學者。如果你失敗了，我不會饒了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "失敗的代價就是慘死，很慘。我說到做到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈，你把話說成這樣，那我還能怎麼接呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "祝你好運，我的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "濃煙四起，滿地狼藉，不用靠近就能掌握大致狀況了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒想到是這種規模的本地騷亂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "貿然介入一定會出問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "啊，情況怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......一片混亂，鎮子北邊的大宅附近一直有人在打鬥，其中一方像是雇傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "其他地方更糟，四下都是血跡和半塌的房屋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......感染的沙地獸在巷子裡竄行，數量不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "局勢已經這樣了，薩爾貢的官方武裝力量呢？王酋的軍隊呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "北邊的大宅裡有一些裝備統一的衛兵，但是沒看到其他薩爾貢士兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果這種程度的騷亂持續了兩天，那安全屋的那位幹員......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "凶多吉少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "先不要下結論。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......另一個消息是，我找到安全屋了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有人駐守在安全屋那邊，但不是羅德島的人員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "安全屋已經被雇傭兵佔領了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不......不一樣，不太像是普通的雇傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們的防禦陣地非常專業，伏擊火力點、陷阱、誘餌一應俱全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "最重要的是，安全屋裡有很多鎮民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "鎮民？駐守陣地的是什麼樣的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看起來像是你們的同行，他們有銃器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "銃器？黑鋼的傭兵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們身上沒有明顯的標誌，不一定是黑鋼傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "抹去了身份標識的專業武裝人員......還帶著銃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊......頭疼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "鎮子裡有很多不同的勢力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "可以排除是匪幫劫掠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "沒看到王酋的軍隊，也不像是戰爭行為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "這裡的情況遠比老夫預想的......要複雜很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "願意在騷亂中保護鎮民的人應該不是什麼窮凶極惡的歹徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "說不定可以嘗試交涉一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "謹慎一點，即便只從他們保護鎮民的行為來判斷，也有很多不同的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "老夫只期望對方是可以溝通的那種人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "不行，完全搞不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "這東西，看起來像是電路板，但是和我瞭解的電路差太多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "如果給我一個月時間，外帶一本技術手冊，我說不定能研究明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "算了，我還是去樓上站崗吧，蹲得我腰都酸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "辛苦了，Lord。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "沒搞定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "這個通訊器的內部結構全都是我們沒接觸過的技術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "我覺得可以放棄維修了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "從外觀上完全看不出來，感覺就只是一台發報機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "和之前那輛廂型車一樣，這個世界的能源基礎很特殊，所有技術的基礎全部都來自這種叫源石的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們還在研究那台通訊器啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "源石通訊設備使用了很複雜的技術，以往都是需要羅德島外派工程術師來維護的，修不好很正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "你之前說用這台機器聯繫到了救援？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉......我不確定是不是真的聯繫到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那些暴徒攻擊安全屋的時候，我手忙腳亂地啟動了通訊器，但是還沒來得及說幾句就被他們闖進來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "當時情況太緊急了，我也口齒不清的......說不定收到求援的羅德島幹員根本就沒聽清我說了什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "所以沒有援軍了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "一開始我就沒期待過援軍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們看起來一點都不緊張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "不如說，沒有支援的作戰，我們已經習慣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉，現在想想，你們當時再來晚一點啊，我這下半輩子就得在輪椅上度過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "也有可能直接躺在棺材裡，連輪椅都不需要了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "還是得謝謝你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "不用客氣，你也幫了那些鎮民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎呀，也不能這麼說，畢竟救治感染者也是羅德島的本業嘛，哈哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......雖然我只是個看門的後勤預備幹員就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "救治......所以這裡才準備了醫療物資？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "但是這些武器是做什麼的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，這個嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "雖然羅德島的本業是製藥，但是安全屋其實並不提供醫療救助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "安全屋主要負責為外勤戰鬥人員提供物資補給，備用武器什麼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "等等？這是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "這是榴彈發射器？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "榴彈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "給我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "好傢伙，這個是地雷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "種類還挺多啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "......我一開始還以為這裡的人都不使用熱兵器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "這個榴彈發射器的結構有點奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "沒有發射藥的榴彈，難道要靠壓縮氣體打出去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "你看這個，還有用液壓彈簧的型號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小心！那箱子裡面是源石爆炸物，很危險！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "奧克芬先生，這裡有槍械彈藥嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "槍械......你是說銃器？啊，你在問蝕刻彈藥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那種昂貴的東西，安全屋一般不會準備，羅德島的戰鬥人員裡很少有人用銃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "這些爆炸物，我們能用嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們得小心點，源石爆炸物都很危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "放在以往，這些東西只有專職戰鬥的幹員才能調用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不過你們看起來都是箇中好手，我也不好說什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "非常感謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "這些呢？這些稀奇古怪的零件是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那些是施術單元備用裝置，小心別弄壞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "施術單元......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "應該是那個叫“源石技藝”的東西吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "源石技藝，就是那些丟火球的技術？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這個講起來就複雜了，我也不是術師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而且源石技藝的種類五花八門，術師們擅長的方向都不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "那剛才提到的工程術師也是其中一種？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎麼？你們以前沒接觸過源石技藝？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "這個嘛......我們見識得比較少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這怎麼可能呢？你們都拿著銃，你們不是術師嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不會使用源石技藝的銃械使用者？嘿，這可稀奇了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，奧克芬先生，你的腳還沒有好，不建議你下地走路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒事沒事，有拐杖，勉強能走兩步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "醫生，下面的病人們怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大部分人的傷勢都穩定下來了，多虧這裡的醫療設備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "你的臉色很不好，沒問題吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只是一晚上沒睡，沒有關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "你需要多休息，如果我們中唯一的醫生累倒了，就本末倒置了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "放心吧，我會注意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "說起來源石技藝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "有沒有那種，念一段咒語，然後一陣閃光之後病就好了的法術？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "噗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你在說什麼啊，哈哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "沒有嗎？那喝下去就能癒合傷口的治療藥水呢？也沒有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那種東西只有科幻小說裡才有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "能夠治癒傷痛的源石技藝確實存在，不過這一類源石技藝都是極難掌握的類型。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "想要掌握這種源石技藝，施術者首先需要掌握全面的醫學知識，瞭解不同種族的身體結構等等......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不過，大部分醫療源石技藝的使用者也只能做到止血或是加速傷口癒合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這類源石技藝在手術台上非常重要，但在我的經驗裡，它們不能替代真正的醫治。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "醫生，你會使用源石技藝嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "略懂一點......雖然沒什麼大用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "這也太現實了......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "有魔法的世界也這麼不方便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "稍等，你剛才說了科幻小說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "我還真有點好奇你們世界的科幻小說是什麼樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "在大一點的城市能找到書店嗎？歷史書籍呢？賣得貴嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "我確實越來越感興趣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們幾個還真是奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們是從哪兒來的？哥倫比亞？維多利亞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們說話的口音聽起來像是好幾十年前的維多利亞人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "這個......我還真不知道怎麼回答你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "寇恩小姐他們來自一個很遙遠的地方，那裡甚至連礦石病都沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什麼？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "......是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒有礦石病的國度，真的假的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒有礦石病，沒有感染者，那豈不是也沒有對感染者的歧視，大地上所有人都是平等的，多少仇恨打一開始就不存在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我的媽啊，那得是什麼樣的好地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......好吧，看你們表情也知道了，就當我沒問吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "敵襲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "報告情況！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "這只是第一波，他們圍上來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "之前只是試探性的進攻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "更多人正在靠近！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "陷阱呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "沒有問題！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "注意補充一下爆炸物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Blitz，注意左翼，不要讓他們繞過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Lord，節約彈藥！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "沒事，讓他們來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "眼觀四面，謹防偷襲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "讓我看看他們有什麼本事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "他們來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "先別開槍......等他們再靠近一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "九點鐘方向！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "Lord，正前方，敵人又站起來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "敵人倒下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "這些長角的大個子不好對付，瞄準頭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "Ash！看那邊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "那是什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "Lord！小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "*俄語粗口*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "亞歷山大！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "我沒事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "先別管我！堅守防線！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "這是什麼鬼東西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "注意那些畸形的人形生物！不要躲在輕掩體後面！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "專業的陣地構建，這四個人可不是等閒之輩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "銃器的聲音......不......這種激烈的爆響，是速射型號的大型銃器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......他們被包圍了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "襲擊者和攻擊大宅的傭兵是同一撥人，不會錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......這些怪物，讓我想起在龍門的經歷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "“宿主”和“牧群”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是不太一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "手持大型銃器的傭兵和驅使神秘怪物戰鬥的傭兵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "局勢在變化，平衡馬上就要被打破。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "毋需猶豫，準備作戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "操縱這種怪物作戰的人絕非善類，不需要對他們手下留情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
